author=gasciljh
description=Smart DNS filtering with DNSCrypt. Local resolver on 127.0.0.1:5354, per-profile HaGeZi blocklists (Light→Ultimate), bilingual WebUI (EN/AR), JSON metrics Dashboard, installable PWA, 10-layer user-data preservation with transactional upgrades and recovery mode. v1.6.0 fixes WebUI timezone display and updates PWA assets. Zero telemetry.
